#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use the Sampler primitive with the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API."
msgstr "Paano gamitin ang Sampler primitive gamit ang IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler with the REST API"
msgstr "Sampler gamit ang REST API"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore IIZII, XIZZZ, accum */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore IIZII, XIZZZ, accum */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler with the REST API {#sampler-with-the-rest-api}"
msgstr "Sampler gamit ang REST API {#sampler-with-the-rest-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The steps in this topic describe how to run and configure workloads with the REST API, and demonstrate how to invoke them in any program of your choice.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga hakbang sa paksang ito ay naglalarawan kung paano magpatakbo at mag-configure ng mga workload gamit ang REST API, at nagpapakita kung paano ilunsad ang mga ito sa anumang programa ng iyong pagpili.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "This documentation utilizes the Python `requests` module to demonstrate the Qiskit Runtime REST API. However, this workflow can be executed using any language or framework that supports working with REST APIs. Refer to the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/tags/jobs) for details.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This documentation utilizes the Python `requests` module to demonstrate the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API. However, this workflow can be executed using any language or framework that supports working with REST APIs. Refer to the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest) for details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang dokumentasyong ito ay gumagamit ng Python na module na `requests` para ipakita ang Qiskit Runtime REST API. Gayunpaman, maaaring isagawa ang workflow na ito gamit ang anumang wika o framework na sumusuporta sa paggawa gamit ang mga REST API. Sumangguni sa [dokumentasyon ng API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/tags/jobs) para sa mga detalye.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. I-initialize ang account {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You first need to initialize your account. You can then select the device you want to use to run your calculations on.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan mo munang i-initialize ang iyong account. Maaari kang pumili ng device na gusto mong gamitin para patakbuhin ang iyong mga kalkulasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find details on how to initialize your account, view available backends, and work with tokens in [Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang mga detalye kung paano i-initialize ang iyong account, tingnan ang mga available na backend, at gumana gamit ang mga token sa [I-set up para gamitin ang IBM Quantum Platform gamit ang REST API](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Create a QASM circuit {#2-create-a-qasm-circuit}"
msgstr "2. Lumikha ng QASM circuit {#2-create-a-qasm-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need at least one circuit as the input to the Sampler primitive.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan mo ng kahit isang circuit bilang input sa Sampler primitive.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define a QASM quantum circuit:\n"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang isang QASM quantum circuit:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The code snippets given below assume that the `qasm_string` has been transpiled to a new string `resulting_qasm`.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga snippet ng code na ibinibigay sa ibaba ay ipinapalagay na ang `qasm_string` ay na-transpile sa isang bagong string na `resulting_qasm`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Run the quantum circuit using Sampler V2 API {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-sampler-v2-api}"
msgstr "3. Patakbuhin ang quantum circuit gamit ang Sampler V2 API {#3-run-the-quantum-circuit-using-sampler-v2-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The jobs below use [Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives). `SamplerV2` takes one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple parameters, and returns one result per PUB.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The jobs below use IBM Quantum V2 primitives. `SamplerV2` takes one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple parameters, and returns one result per PUB.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang mga job sa ibaba ay gumagamit ng [Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives). Ang `SamplerV2` ay tumatanggap ng isa o higit pang primitive unified bloc (PUB) bilang input. Ang bawat PUB ay isang tuple na naglalaman ng isang circuit at ng data na ina-broadcast sa circuit na iyon, na maaaring maraming parameter, at nagbabalik ng isang resulta bawat PUB.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

